- In Variables what data we saved that data will be deleted once program is finished.
- When we save for data permanently then go for files.
File
----
- A file is a container used to store data permanently
- Files help us store data even after program execution ends

Files are 2 types, they are
1. Text File
2. Binary Files

1. Text File
-------------
i)Text file
- Text file = filename.txt

ii)CSV file
- Sometime we will be called CSV( Comma Separated Values) file.
- CSV example
  ------------
  eid,ename,sal
  101,varma,32000.0
  102,sharma,28000.0
- Everything separated with comma so it is called CSV file.
- CSV file= filename.csv

iii)Excel File
---------------
- Excel file = filename.xlsx

iv)json file
-------------
- Json = filename.json
- Json store data in form of key,value = Dictionary format.
- In real time if you want to move data from one location to anathor internally they use json.

